WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:26.100
Hanasakeru Seishonen

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:36.220
I know that you two are worried about me.

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:41.470
But, I can't go back now.
 I'm an adult now!

00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:44.490
I want to choose my own destiny!

00:01:44.690 --> 00:01:49.060
If I turn my back on everyone here, I will regret it forever!

00:01:49.690 --> 00:01:52.730
Don't let me live my life like that!

00:01:53.560 --> 00:01:54.840
Please.

00:01:57.130 --> 00:02:00.750
- I beg you, please.
- Do things the way you want to.

00:02:02.230 --> 00:02:06.200
- Master Lee-Leng!
- Lee-Leng! - Are you serious?!

00:02:06.550 --> 00:02:11.520
Yes, I'm serious. 
 In that case, let me do as I please too.

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:21.270
I will step down as the leader of the Huang Group.

00:02:21.930 --> 00:02:26.800
Lies and Truths

00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:38.560
So that's what you look like when you put a lot of makeup on.

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:43.630
Don't I look like the tailor's assistant?!

00:02:44.210 --> 00:02:49.920
- Master Kajika, must you go?
- Yea. The tailors come in threes.

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:54.390
Sezun knows his way around the palace, so we have to leave you here, Toranosuke.

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:57.650
It's useless for me to say anything but...

00:02:58.260 --> 00:03:01.900
- ...please don't do anything reckless.
- I got it.

00:03:04.060 --> 00:03:07.350
It's so odd. 
 I'm not afraid at all.

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:12.030
- You should be a little afraid.
-<i> It's because...</i>

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:14.940
<i>...Lee-Leng, you're with me.</i>

00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:19.790
<i>Do you remember that time we explored that cave?</i>

00:03:20.890 --> 00:03:24.090
<i>I'm getting the same excitement that I got back then!</i>

00:03:25.570 --> 00:03:31.320
<i>You tightly gripped my hand.
 It was like, we were the only ones on this planet.</i>

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:36.300
<i>If the both of us are together...</i>

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:40.520
<i>...nothing scares me.</i>

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:44.190
- Time has come.
- OK.

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:49.960
His Highness Rumaty has applied to enter the country?

00:03:50.740 --> 00:03:55.170
- What did the government do? 
- They approved it. - It can't be!

00:03:55.740 --> 00:04:00.190
That was unexpected. 
 I didn't know you'd be against it, Master Quinza.

00:04:01.020 --> 00:04:05.690
It's a great chance!
 We should get him at the airport and imprison him.

00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:08.480
It's like carrying a seed for civil war!

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:13.080
- His Highness should not be allowed in the country! 
- But...

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:16.040
- Imprisoning him is not enough!

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:20.390
As long as His Highness lives, the throne of the current king is in jeopardy.

00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:26.600
- We should get rid of His Highness. 
- Are you trying to dishonor the Gods of Ragi?!

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:31.720
I, Quinza, have given my life to the royal family!

00:04:32.020 --> 00:04:36.900
Even though I am a rebel, if you dare harm the royal family, I will...

00:04:37.530 --> 00:04:41.850
Master Quinza, Captain Namka was only drawing an example.

00:04:42.270 --> 00:04:47.730
- Yea--yea.
- Do not allow His Highness to enter this country.

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:53.180
It's best to stomp out the embers before it flares.

00:04:53.880 --> 00:04:57.400
You're right. His Highness has many enemies.

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:03.180
Even if they doubt us, we can say it was the king's orders.

00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:07.700
The king and His Highness Rumaty aren't the only royalties.

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:11.120
We can just have the king step aside.

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:16.240
- All we have to do is be under the command of the new king.
- Brilliant, Sareha-san.

00:05:16.970 --> 00:05:21.070
But, you are starting to sound like Master Quinza.

00:05:21.140 --> 00:05:24.690
I won't be bound by old conventions.

00:05:25.140 --> 00:05:29.030
- I'm not like that royal fanatic over there. 
- That's perfect.

00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:38.180
- Is that what Sareha was saying?
- Yes.

00:05:38.630 --> 00:05:43.930
He was planning to assassinate His Highness at the airport and blame it on the king.

00:05:44.910 --> 00:05:46.820
- How foolish.

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:53.550
I would have let him roam around if he was quiet.

00:05:56.420 --> 00:05:59.960
My father is sick today, so we are here instead.

00:06:00.940 --> 00:06:02.980
The two are my assistants.

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:15.140
Don't worry about them.
 They come often.

00:06:15.610 --> 00:06:18.530
Alright...

00:06:20.140 --> 00:06:24.680
Just as planned, the priest is going to visit Lieutenant Noei for his penitence.

00:06:25.890 --> 00:06:27.800
- Do the best you can.
- Yes.

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:36.090
- The tailor is here.
- Come in.

00:06:45.040 --> 00:06:47.250
- Mustafa!
- Kajika?!

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:52.420
-Who are you guys?! 
- Raisa please--- be quiet.

00:06:53.020 --> 00:06:58.180
- They're not here to harm us. 
- Master Eugene. - Mustafa!

00:06:59.780 --> 00:07:02.400
Kajika. How reckless of you.

00:07:03.950 --> 00:07:06.420
Lee-Leng, what is this about?!

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:12.850
I forced them to take me. 
 Isaac is also held captive.

00:07:13.230 --> 00:07:16.040
- He's going to be executed! 
- Noei is?!

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:20.890
Sezun and I are going to rescue Noei. 
 It's better not to go in a large group.

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:25.130
Eugene, head to the Temple with Kajika.

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:30.410
The escape tunnel is hard to find. 
 So please wait there.

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:36.720
Let's meet 30 minutes from now. 
 If you wait five minutes and I don't show up, Kajika...

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:40.310
- ...escape with Eugene. 
- Lee-Leng.

00:07:41.470 --> 00:07:43.880
Eugene, take care of Kajika.

00:07:46.590 --> 00:07:48.100
I got it.

00:07:49.730 --> 00:07:53.600
Don't worry. I won't make you wait. 
 I'll be back with Noei in no time.

00:07:54.460 --> 00:07:56.420
Alright. I'll be waiting.

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:11.060
Lee-Leng, please hurry. 
 Come as quick as you can.

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:21.140
Najayra?!

00:08:22.240 --> 00:08:25.380
Did she hear about the fuss with Sareha?

00:08:29.560 --> 00:08:34.500
- This is the priest, Master Ikai. 
- Please don't be too rough. - I got it.

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:45.660
I am Ikai, here for the penitence. These two are the chamberlains accompanying me.

00:08:46.410 --> 00:08:48.400
Thank you for coming.

00:08:51.990 --> 00:08:54.480
Noei-san is at the end.

00:08:57.320 --> 00:08:59.000
I can see him now.

00:09:01.610 --> 00:09:03.420
<i>There are two of them.</i>

00:09:08.570 --> 00:09:11.790
He's a quiet one, but don't get too close.

00:09:16.060 --> 00:09:17.520
What are you doing?!

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:26.560
- Lieutenant Noei, are you alright? 
- Sezun? What are you doing here?

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:29.280
We have to hurry!

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:32.170
Lee-Leng! Take this.

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:36.790
- Just wear this. 
 - This is the priest's.

00:09:37.520 --> 00:09:40.080
Thank the priest for helping us out.

00:09:41.240 --> 00:09:44.680
- I apologize. 
 - Hurry and go.

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:50.560
Master Eugene, you'll be killed!

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:54.100
They'll know that I've helped you escape!

00:09:54.850 --> 00:09:56.740
Raisa, calm down.

00:09:57.470 --> 00:10:01.660
I shouldn't have delivered that letter! 
 You used me!

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:03.970
How terrible! I can't believe it!

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:07.040
<i>What should I do?! 
 We don't have time for this.</i>

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:10.660
Your shift is up.

00:10:12.770 --> 00:10:15.730
If we get past that, the temple is there, but...

00:10:17.370 --> 00:10:18.900
It's rough.

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:25.480
You got called out by Sareha didn't you?
 He's going to beg you for money.

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:29.700
<i>I don't care what the reason is. As long as I can get into the palace.</i>

00:10:30.680 --> 00:10:36.290
<i>I don't know where Kajika is. If Quinza learns about Kajika's descent...</i>

00:10:37.520 --> 00:10:40.330
<i>That is what's worrying me the most right now.</i>

00:10:41.460 --> 00:10:44.380
<i>On top of that, I have to find out where Eugene is.</i>

00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:51.160
Sareha is planning to depose Somand and place a new king.

00:10:51.610 --> 00:10:54.780
Is that the message you received from God?

00:10:55.780 --> 00:11:00.360
I can't hear those things. 
 I'm not able to anymore.

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:07.540
That might be a good thing. 
 That you're a normal person.

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:13.870
To worry about the future like normal human beings do...

00:11:14.170 --> 00:11:17.590
...might give you the ability to see the fortunes and misfortunes of the people.

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:23.820
I've been a normal person since birth. I was always worried.

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:28.090
That's how a person can love another person.

00:11:32.620 --> 00:11:36.890
Is it because you are worried?

00:11:37.410 --> 00:11:39.020
Is that why you like Kajika?

00:11:45.630 --> 00:11:51.060
- What are they doing?! 
- We won't make it in time like this. - We have to get past them!

00:11:53.720 --> 00:11:58.920
- A crowd of demonstrators are headed toward the palace!
- What? - The people are headed this way!

00:11:59.470 --> 00:12:02.310
- It can't be! 
 - Head outside!

00:12:03.220 --> 00:12:05.780
- Alright they're gone! 
- Now's our chance!

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:09.500
Will Kajika be alright?!

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:19.170
Mustafa--- I can't believe you!

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:21.610
There's nothing to worry about.

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:26.580
You're known as a prude maid.

00:12:28.320 --> 00:12:33.640
- You were just drugged and fell asleep, right? 
- Master Eugene.

00:12:35.130 --> 00:12:37.290
Right, it is as you said.

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:40.650
I got afraid and lost my cool.

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:43.470
It's alright. Don't worry.

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:47.460
- Don't hate me. 
- I won't.

00:12:50.630 --> 00:12:52.540
Alright, let's go.

00:12:52.920 --> 00:12:56.960
- Raisa, don't forget to take the pills.
- Yes!

00:12:59.050 --> 00:13:00.980
I can't believe you would do something like that!

00:13:01.180 --> 00:13:03.490
That's called "sweet talking!"

00:13:04.530 --> 00:13:07.300
All I did was open her hardened heart up.

00:13:09.320 --> 00:13:11.700
She'll be able to fall in love with someone else.

00:13:12.960 --> 00:13:15.680
Her life will be filled with joy now.

00:13:19.950 --> 00:13:21.650
But, I can't agree with what you did!

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:24.350
There, that's the temple.

00:13:25.760 --> 00:13:29.060
Wow, it's really big up close.

00:13:30.140 --> 00:13:31.960
Deep in the temple...

00:13:32.440 --> 00:13:36.230
...Rumaty's grandpa, His Majesty Machaty's Throne of God resides.

00:13:39.120 --> 00:13:43.650
Hanasakeru Seishonen

00:13:49.380 --> 00:13:51.870
It seems like Lee-Leng hasn't arrived yet.

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:59.700
- Someone's coming.
- How long has it been since I came here?

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:03.840
- So, you have something you want to discuss today?
- Yes.

00:14:05.090 --> 00:14:06.770
That's Najayra's mother.

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:11.580
- Well...
- Who is that there?!

00:14:12.600 --> 00:14:16.010
- Guards! 
- Wait! Hear me out!

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:18.340
Oh, Master Kajika!

00:14:18.880 --> 00:14:22.320
We are here to rescue the man that's going to be executed!

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:25.980
But, that man is innocent!

00:14:26.400 --> 00:14:29.040
All he was doing was helping Rumaty out!

00:14:29.580 --> 00:14:33.150
- You are... 
- Kajika Burnsworth.

00:14:34.330 --> 00:14:36.080
What's happening?!

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:38.880
That I would see Master Kajika here.

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:41.850
This must be a sign from God.

00:14:42.160 --> 00:14:45.510
- Are you alright?!
- Master Ririka?!

00:14:46.180 --> 00:14:49.360
The reason why I came here to the high priest...

00:14:49.810 --> 00:14:52.330
...was to discuss this matter.

00:14:53.060 --> 00:14:56.980
- What do you mean?
- My mother, Sereira...

00:14:57.100 --> 00:15:00.030
...was King Machaty's second wife and at the same time...

00:15:00.380 --> 00:15:03.320
...was the most understanding of His Majesty.

00:15:04.690 --> 00:15:09.020
His Majesty only told my mother about that secret.

00:15:10.160 --> 00:15:11.120
<i>Secret?!</i>

00:15:13.450 --> 00:15:17.300
Don't the Rosenthals wish for the king to abdicate the throne?

00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:20.260
You have been pushing His Highness Izmal.

00:15:20.930 --> 00:15:23.960
So you need money in order to do that?

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:26.540
You won't be losing out.

00:15:27.210 --> 00:15:29.120
Actually, my father has retired.

00:15:29.310 --> 00:15:31.860
I am going to take his place.

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:35.840
I was immediately accepted by the board of directors.

00:15:37.140 --> 00:15:39.340
The Rosenthals will no longer be like they were before.

00:15:39.880 --> 00:15:43.580
Therefore, we are cutting our ties as of now.

00:15:44.470 --> 00:15:46.670
- Excuse me.
- Please, wait!

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:54.250
- Oh, Master Carl Rosenthal. 
- Yes.

00:15:54.950 --> 00:15:57.910
I hear your name often from Her Highness Najayra.

00:15:58.770 --> 00:16:01.990
Nice to meet you, I am Quinza Hafez.

00:16:03.710 --> 00:16:06.350
- You are.
- Going back on the helicopter?

00:16:07.720 --> 00:16:11.320
Captain Namka will be headed out too.

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:13.810
You might not be able to leave immediately.

00:16:14.540 --> 00:16:19.860
- Is that so.
- Her Highness Najayra doesn't seem like herself today.

00:16:20.340 --> 00:16:22.860
Can you drop her off later?

00:16:23.300 --> 00:16:25.630
I will do so.

00:16:26.770 --> 00:16:28.880
<i>I get it Quinza.</i>

00:16:29.510 --> 00:16:33.270
<i>You can tell he has his guard up from his eyes.</i> 
 Now, excuse me.

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:43.690
Master Sareha. The King has decided to get married.

00:16:44.830 --> 00:16:48.180
- He decided to take Najayra as his wife.
- What?!

00:16:49.330 --> 00:16:51.940
<i>If she becomes queen, her power will increase.</i>

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:55.350
<i>If the Rosenthals are also leaving me...</i>

00:16:55.790 --> 00:16:58.820
<i>...I might have to rethink about pushing Izmal forth.</i>

00:17:00.060 --> 00:17:05.760
The King has given you this as a token of his appreciation.

00:17:06.780 --> 00:17:10.670
- From the King? 
- The King has been getting well recently.

00:17:12.710 --> 00:17:17.490
I don't know how to explain it. It seems like he is a kid again.

00:17:19.940 --> 00:17:22.840
<i>He's regressing and becoming like a kid.</i>

00:17:25.510 --> 00:17:28.890
- It's some kind of switch. 
- It must be some kind of toy.

00:17:29.300 --> 00:17:34.050
- Just play along with his silly games. 
- So I just press this?

00:17:37.430 --> 00:17:42.270
- What has happened?! 
- It seems like the helicopter exploded.- Helicopter?

00:17:42.780 --> 00:17:48.290
- No, not with Namka aboard! 
- I can't believe the King plays such silly games.

00:17:50.580 --> 00:17:55.870
- No! 
- You've done something terrible, Master Sareha.

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:12.880
- What was that explosion? 
- It was Namka's helicopter.

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:16.320
Was it an act of terrorism? 
 We were about to get sucked in.

00:18:17.310 --> 00:18:19.060
Quinza is the one who did it.

00:18:20.680 --> 00:18:24.120
Finally, I understand the message from God.

00:18:25.970 --> 00:18:27.090
Your Highness Najayra?!

00:18:29.060 --> 00:18:32.530
Quinza will never let me get bored...

00:18:33.330 --> 00:18:36.610
...if I tremble in fear, I won't be bored!

00:18:38.710 --> 00:18:43.360
<i>That man can't know Kajika's secret!</i>

00:18:50.050 --> 00:18:55.120
In the past His Majesty Machaty loved a woman in New York.

00:18:56.040 --> 00:18:59.740
That woman left His Majesty's sight but...

00:19:00.060 --> 00:19:03.460
...she was already with His Majesty's child.

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:10.090
At His Majesty's wish, my mother found the whereabouts of the woman.

00:19:10.410 --> 00:19:12.770
And found information about the child.

00:19:15.350 --> 00:19:17.420
Harry Burnsworth.

00:19:18.660 --> 00:19:23.400
Your father was the one that was supposed to be the King of Raginei.

00:19:27.160 --> 00:19:27.990
No!

00:19:30.510 --> 00:19:34.940
If that's the truth. 
 The one to succeed the throne...

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:37.710
Is not Somand nor Rumaty.

00:19:38.340 --> 00:19:41.180
It's without a doubt, you, Kajika!

00:19:42.230 --> 00:19:46.400
Wait a minute! 
 I can't comprehend it being told out of the blue!

00:19:47.070 --> 00:19:51.400
Director Harry knew.
 That's why he protected Kajika.

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:54.530
The search for a husband was just a guise.

00:19:55.610 --> 00:19:59.370
He was trying to find a man that would protect her at whatever the cost.

00:20:01.690 --> 00:20:05.420
- Kajika! 
- Lee-Leng! Lee-Leng!

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:11.030
- What just happened? 
- Did you know, Lee-Leng?

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:13.860
That Dad was King Machaty's child?

00:20:15.390 --> 00:20:16.220
Kajika?!

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:20.740
- Don't be foolish. Who told you that?! 
- I've had it!

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:23.830
How many years have we spent together?

00:20:25.110 --> 00:20:26.990
When you react like that...

00:20:28.550 --> 00:20:32.180
- ...it means it's true.
- Kajika.

00:20:33.230 --> 00:20:39.600
Now I understand why you didn't want me to get close to Raginei.

00:20:43.520 --> 00:20:48.840
I knew that I would not be able to go to the land of the Sun knowing this secret alone.

00:20:50.970 --> 00:20:55.880
I apologize for my rudeness even in my ignorance, Your Highness!

00:20:57.790 --> 00:21:01.990
- Everyone please forget what has happened in the past. 
- Lee-Leng.

00:21:03.780 --> 00:21:06.800
Don't put any more burdens on Kajika!

00:21:08.170 --> 00:21:13.910
- I understand.
- Master Kajika, it is dangerous here. We must escape immediately.

00:21:17.220 --> 00:21:22.440
<i>Now I understand why I was so worried about this country.</i>

00:21:24.040 --> 00:21:29.010
But, there was one time when I was moved by a boy's tears.

00:21:30.920 --> 00:21:35.030
I thought it was the most beautiful thing.

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:38.340
I thought, this is love.

00:21:41.840 --> 00:21:46.050
<i>I want to tell him, that Kathleen loved you until the end.</i>

00:21:47.190 --> 00:21:51.080
<i>But, I don't have time for that.
 I'm regretful.</i>

00:21:51.780 --> 00:21:54.360
I understand your feelings, Master Kajika.

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:59.300
Even if you were the King, you would not be able to meet him.

00:22:00.130 --> 00:22:04.050
I know. The Throne of God can only be seen by the high priest, right?

00:22:04.710 --> 00:22:07.390
But, that's just strange. It has no meaning.

00:22:08.250 --> 00:22:10.260
We just need to change the things that aren't right.

00:22:11.560 --> 00:22:14.780
If Rumaty becomes king, he'll change that.

00:22:15.260 --> 00:22:18.570
Until then I'll look forward to it. 
 I'll see you then!

00:22:25.290 --> 00:22:30.420
Master Ririka, I was doubtful just a moment ago...

00:22:31.470 --> 00:22:33.570
...but, now I'm convinced.

00:22:34.150 --> 00:22:37.490
Master Kajika is Master Machaty's grandchild.

00:22:38.190 --> 00:22:41.950
His Majesty told me in the same way.

00:22:42.940 --> 00:22:47.110
If we go into this world wanting to change things...

00:22:47.400 --> 00:22:49.250
...things are never impossible.

00:22:50.780 --> 00:22:55.940
As His Majesty said, he kept his words.

00:22:56.320 --> 00:22:59.470
And brought about modernization to this country.

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:23.730
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
